{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/d2364613caebc5f2a7fc33a3f99636ad.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=328 /></span><strong>Exquisite Touhou Danmaku, Seven Years in the Making</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThe Unreachable Oneiroborder\u201d is a Touhou Project danmaku shoot-em-up fangame. The game is easy to learn, regardless of your prior experience with bullet hells. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/1b4b336b9a784c3cf0a8b529aba51fbd.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you\u2019ve imagined your dreams coming true? One day, humans' dreams materialized into reality, satisfying their cravings and fulfilling their desires\u2026 a fantastic development, certainly. Yet, after the first nightmare materialized itself, sleep became an unspeakably horrific taboo in Gensokyo. The Dream Manifestation Incident has begun\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Reimu Hakurei, Marisa Kirisame, Sanae Kochiya and Sumireko Usami; uncover the truth behind the suspicious phenomenon, and solve the incident that has shaken Gensokyo's very foundations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/7e75eae213ae16c8ed611639b7baadf0.avif?t=1763288874\" width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dazzling Showcase of Danmaku</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/101b13e7c3af185cf8ff7910c5bd1fe7.poster.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/101b13e7c3af185cf8ff7910c5bd1fe7.webm?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/101b13e7c3af185cf8ff7910c5bd1fe7.mp4?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/a4461352bf46905db34bd7c73ec096e9.poster.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/a4461352bf46905db34bd7c73ec096e9.webm?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/a4461352bf46905db34bd7c73ec096e9.mp4?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Stylish Counterattacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/e0b6e9760fef0d3091ea63ce61cca843.poster.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/e0b6e9760fef0d3091ea63ce61cca843.webm?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/e0b6e9760fef0d3091ea63ce61cca843.mp4?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/d195ce3c531ca84495cef81a680c1583.poster.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/d195ce3c531ca84495cef81a680c1583.webm?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/d195ce3c531ca84495cef81a680c1583.mp4?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/5e43e9cdf93e6a6ef8f866c058b3d5e5.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic vertical shmup with modern features </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness beautiful danmaku performances, and break through the enemies\u2019 prized spell card attacks! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the thrill of bullet grazing by, as you improve your skills in intense battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty levels to accommodate all skill levels, from complete beginners to seasoned experts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes with different gameplay styles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 shottype configurations with 6 different spell cards each, tailored to resolving the incident </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive music and visuals to bring you a Touhou-filled experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather \u201cDreamscape Fragments\u201d in the game to peruse the sights and sounds of Gensokyo in the Gallery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modernized Player Data menus with extensive options and details to reminisce upon your past records</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai