astic development, certainly. Yet, after the first nightmare materialized itself, sleep became an unspeakably horrific taboo in Gensokyo. The Dream Manifestation Incident has begun\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Reimu Hakurei, Marisa Kirisame, Sanae Kochiya and Sumireko Usami; uncover the truth behind the suspicious phenomenon, and solve the incident that has shaken Gensokyo's very foundations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/7e75eae213ae16c8ed611639b7baadf0.avif?t=1763288874\" width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dazzling Showcase of Danmaku</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/101b13e7c3af185cf8ff7910c5bd1fe7.poster.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/101b13e7c3af185cf8ff7910c5bd1fe7.webm?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/101b13e7c3af185cf8ff7910c5bd1fe7.mp4?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/a4461352bf46905db34bd7c73ec096e9.poster.avif?t=1763288874\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/a4461352bf46905db34bd7c73ec096e9.webm?t=1763288874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass